{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You follow a small group of friends brought together by a shared mission: to find someone they\u2019ve lost. As they search across Haifa\u2019s streets, homes, and hidden corners, they\u2019ll confront not only external obstacles but also their own emotional scars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/4b77bd365534d9a188acf37ab440b9fc.poster.avif?t=1773076715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/4b77bd365534d9a188acf37ab440b9fc.webm?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/4b77bd365534d9a188acf37ab440b9fc.mp4?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each richly illustrated scene, you\u2019ll investigate the environment for clues, some of them - objects that hold personal meaning and fragments of the larger mystery. Some items offer comfort, others trigger painful memories, but every discovery brings you closer to uncovering what happened and why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These findings don\u2019t just move the story forward; they shape the mental state of the people you\u2019re traveling with, influencing how they perceive the truth as it unfolds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.poster.avif?t=1773076715\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.webm?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.mp4?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through these moments of empathy and reflection, you\u2019ll also begin to piece together the larger mystery\u2014following leads, connecting clues, and uncovering what happened to the friend they\u2019ve lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.poster.avif?t=1773076715\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.webm?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.mp4?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Detective Puzzle Gameplay</strong>\u00a0- Investigate beautifully illustrated scenes, uncover hidden clues, and piece together a mystery through observation, dialogue, and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope as a Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Each discovery impacts your group\u2019s mental state, affecting their ability to cope with the journey ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Rich with Visual Novel Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Uncover a quiet mystery through emotional dialogue, reflective thoughts, and evolving relationships within a diverse cast of characters shaped by conflict and connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Painted Visuals </strong>\u2013 A visually distinctive, thoughtfully hand-drawn style that captures the beauty and melancholy of everyday moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/26dce4f4015fa47700b16204cb4fd3d2.poster.avif?t=1773076715\" width=344 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/26dce4f4015fa47700b16204cb4fd3d2.webm?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/26dce4f4015fa47700b16204cb4fd3d2.mp4?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Where\u2019s My Bag?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009970/b88a98451aa211d8792d0761ccacf76957016d4e.jpg"},{"name":"Not Alone Anymore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009970/8386246037c1a197b3e951889d5a4de20402d371.jpg"},{"name":"Disconnected","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009970/fb987cf3ee2c23335f77fb874d3b4e6578b00437.jpg"},{"name":"Lost and Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009970/b7e34410b24ada37870c95b15fe947269c3fb5cf.jpg"},{"name":"Meet Bnei Eliyahu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009970/c01e7d2e0c2a6c725bf530ae94d3db7bed3ed344.jpg"},{"name":"At Last\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009970/b04607ebbcd9d4c7b5aebf9219bb8c7e9777495b.jpg"},{"name":"Words Become Blades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3009970/b8405c46734fe88a38219560567461e25687693d.jpg"},{"name":"I Heart Haifa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image