.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/4b77bd365534d9a188acf37ab440b9fc.mp4?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each richly illustrated scene, you\u2019ll investigate the environment for clues, some of them - objects that hold personal meaning and fragments of the larger mystery. Some items offer comfort, others trigger painful memories, but every discovery brings you closer to uncovering what happened and why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These findings don\u2019t just move the story forward; they shape the mental state of the people you\u2019re traveling with, influencing how they perceive the truth as it unfolds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.poster.avif?t=1773076715\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.webm?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/6c85808b541f4c13310ccae8f1be7f01.mp4?t=1773076715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through these moments of empathy and reflection, you\u2019ll also begin to piece together the larger mystery\u2014following leads, connecting clues, and uncovering what happened to the friend they\u2019ve lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/extras/a037538bce9e604b67fffa7d36cbb973.poster.avif?t=1773076715\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3009970/e